Local veneration surrounds him, and Vienne counts him among its patron saints. He is commemorated on 26 May.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zacharias_of_Vienne", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
