Claudius, Castorius, Symphorian (Simpronian), Nicostratus, and Simplicius'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Crowned_Martyrs", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
