Some accounts about him are regarded as unreliable.
Beyond this, little is known of his life. Sources from the 9th century are the first to mention him.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torpes_of_Pisa", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
