The years of their lives and the manner of their deaths are both unknown. Their burial place today is St. Peter''s Basilica, in Rome.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Martinian_and_Processus", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
