A St Serfs Church also stands in the G32 area of the Glasgow East end of Glasgow.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Serf", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
