was a clergyman from Bohemia. He stayed loyal to Archbishop Jan of Jenštejn during a quarrel with the Bohemian crown, and for this King Wenceslaus IV of Bohemia had him executed by throwing him into the Vltava.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_of_Nepomuk", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
