She is honored on 21 January, her feast day. A further association links her to Brideschurch, near Sallins, and possibly to County Waterford''s Kilbride.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint_Br%C3%ADga", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
