On 23 July 1865 he was born in Puthenpally, Varapuzha, Ernakulam District, Kerala State, India. His parents, of the Vithayathil family, were Catholic, and he had two brothers as well as two sisters.'::text) || jsonb_build_object('provenance', '{"article": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Vithayathil", "biography": "rewritten"}'::jsonb),
